WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.860
SWOT analysis audits a brand's situation before you set strategy.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.492
Strengths and weaknesses are internal, things you control.

00:00:08.542 --> 00:00:12.370
Opportunities and threats are external, out in the market.

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:14.220
Take Telstra.

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:16.460
Strength: the biggest network.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.986
Weakness: a reputation barely above the tax office.

00:00:20.036 --> 00:00:22.109
Opportunity: the Olympics.

00:00:22.159 --> 00:00:25.393
Threat: cheaper rivals winning on price.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.854
The value is in the links.

00:00:27.904 --> 00:00:30.354
Use the network strength to seize the Olympics,

00:00:30.404 --> 00:00:33.578
and fix the dull ads before rivals exploit them.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.384
Use it like this:

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:36.693
two or three specific,

00:00:36.743 --> 00:00:38.132
evidenced points per box,

00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:40.993
then the strategic moves they point to.
